[{"title":"秋早登住阁","author":"沈辽","text":"病夫倦拘郁，遐赏寄重阁。\n大火欲西流，高林已摇落。\n海旁土气浅，风雨易回薄。\n数日多狂飙，馀暑亦潜却。\n千山在天际，清气遥可托。\n平生乐烟霞，幽步谁与约。\n缅怀机云辈，襟灵信夷廓。\n草草蹈危机，千载尚可啄。\n吾知非世用，白首甘寂寞。\n摄令亦偶然，何能求民瘼。\n勾钉尽诛敛，下笔良多怍。\n不如陈太丘，行归老丘壑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45135,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云间","author":"沈辽","text":"蜡屐去阳羡，乘桴望云间。\n腰垂陶令印，意在庄生环。\n斯民久困敝，何用惠孤瘝。\n于心傥有愧，拂衣归故山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45136,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉送景升西上","author":"沈辽","text":"京口杨夫子，知名三十秋。\n青衫尚为邑，相见松江头。\n倾盖曾未久，欢若平生游。\n适当及瓜代，浩然治西舟。\n荐章满公车，行想拜恩休。\n万里起跬步，青云眇难俦。\n余方归东路，于此怅夷犹。\n行觞莫辞醉，分袂云间楼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45137,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉和宋平叔","author":"沈辽","text":"海角厌多雨，乍晴山更嘉。\n梅林半黄熟，柳带剩夭斜。\n忽忽久不怿，悠悠谁可涯。\n世如有夫子，终不叹匏瓜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45138,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题上天竺天仙阁","author":"沈辽","text":"久厌朝市冗，粗能忘盖缠。\n头依梵呗地，行结西方缘。\n山前种香稻，山下流清泉。\n此地既岑寂，此心良泰然。\n法师清净观，招我修初禅。\n斯言倘不践，何路休馀年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45139,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬泰叔","author":"沈辽","text":"志士有不遇，繇来多感伤。\n末途长悯默，往事委冥茫。\n偃蹇乾坤外，推移日月长。\n初心寄林壑，何事袭轩裳。\n才地惭前辈，文华笑老苍。\n讨论聊自适，仕进亦惟惶。\n直欲驰千里，宁谁出一乡。\n典谟窥禹契，教化识轩唐。\n不信时难驾，焉知命弗将。\n士虽殊用舍，吾岂托炎凉。\n宝剑埋霜镝，明珠称夜光。\n三公犹可去，一命孰难忘。\n壮节深无累，高歌咏更锵。\n振衣辞旦望，逸迹寄朱张。\n管库心何愧，江湖幸退藏。\n朝辞汴师日，夜渡浙河霜。\n故国寻仙路，当年结客场。\n二毛虽老丑，一醉乃寻常。\n花圃风生席，云斋月满床。\n清歌怜落落，高论接琅琅。\n谁谓羁游地，还陪君子觞。\n众推朋好厚，不间弟兄行。\n斟酌南堂夜，逍遥甬水阳。\n长篇荷高意，他日结离肠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45140,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庭柏","author":"沈辽","text":"郁郁庭下柏，何年移此栽。\n虽然失地性，本自凌云材。\n不复鸾凤集，空馀鸟雀来。\n谁为许长史，拔宅去尘埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45141,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹轩","author":"沈辽","text":"古人爱修竹，潇洒临幽轩。\n劲节有高致，清声无俗喧。\n春日斗锁碎，秋风撼琅玕。\n谁知渭川富，千亩可悬冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45142,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鹂一声","author":"沈辽","text":"阴阴三四木，官舍悄无邻。\n何处黄鹂啭，来惊白发新。\n浪随殊俗过，可负旧山春。\n自笑亲香火，看经作钝人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45143,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"舟行","author":"沈辽","text":"我舟莫行疾，我家日已远。\n行迟终不到，不到何由返。\n吴楚千万里，江山道回转。\n白头多伤感，方寸不胜乱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45144,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道中","author":"沈辽","text":"昔我离家时，月生正如钩。\n行行载见月，已在天南头。\n我身岂当然，吏议不可酬。\n下手亦何愧，摇尾终无求。\n默默就孤征，悽悽怀百忧。\n吴山望不尽，已泛楚江流。\n木落知岁寒，客子多悲愁。\n一恸一斗血，安能望松楸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45145,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九龙洞","author":"沈辽","text":"洞中石乳色如霜，欲煮刀圭未得方。\n叹息此生来已晚，更将残命笑嵇康。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45146,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西津","author":"沈辽","text":"山后山前到已频，更寻残雪过西津。\n愚溪愁客今何在，应有猿猱解笑人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45147,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书","author":"沈辽","text":"病骨愔愔百不如，不应投老更看书。\n古今得丧今方辨，且向斜阳弄蠹鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45148,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"愚溪","author":"沈辽","text":"愚溪水中多圆石，水边竹树山如壁。\n夫子幽栖十二年，至今使人长叹息。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45149,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"白云非我役，出没在山间。\n我亦何所事，篮舆自往还。\n不知乐与否，聊尔寄衰孱。\n早恨冠冕误，空令鬓毛斑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45150,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"我昧明哲戒，置身在天涯。\n悯悯常畏人，岂异池中蛙。\n吴山千万里，梦寐不到家。\n永怀故山乐，轻舟棹烟霞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45151,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其三","author":"沈辽","text":"屈平作天问，委骳穷不悔。\n寥寥千载还，柳子强复对。\n二子诚多材，无乃振憔悴。\n区区亦何为，吾方游物外。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45152,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杂诗 其四","author":"沈辽","text":"巨蛇老且蜕，不如蝉脱飞。\n茫然寄坱圠，生死亦一归。\n达人观元化，其言玄且微。\n生死有不类，于是知者稀。\n秋池夜观月，方与水相辉。\n聊尔乘物化，指象终为非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45153,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诒隐者二首 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"汝勿轻王侯，王侯非汝曹。\n地势有轻重，太山与鸿毛。\n鼓腹一欢笑，不知钟鼓豪。\n我乐彼不预，山林且陶陶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45154,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诒隐者二首 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"访我维摩室，不值香积饭。\n开囊出黄粟，为汝林中爨。\n软语少稽留，青蔬亦易办。\n勿言方外趣，我汝真如幻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45155,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"善饮","author":"沈辽","text":"谁道渊明不善饮，亦知太白爱题诗。\n浪醉浪吟成底事，不如高卧过当时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45156,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夷山","author":"沈辽","text":"夷山邈无际，落日多青烟。\n渺渺寄愁恨，吾知从古然。\n逝者既已矣，后来谁可言。\n达生亦有意，吾归将灌园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45157,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晋室","author":"沈辽","text":"晋室昔中圯，正人多戮死。\n加害宁无辞，惟其不徇己。\n朝室有难置，山林或能已。\n谁云清议在，美玉不全燬。\n旷达余所嘉，数欲玩遗史。\n抚卷辄增感，终夕那复理。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45158,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东岭","author":"沈辽","text":"东岭寄吾庐，西崦多屐齿。\n何为不惮陟，下视湘川水。\n此水不涌激，朝暮流未已。\n烟云媚幽趣，落日更清泚。\n徙倚有高木，独往每自喜。\n山猿助我啸，幽鸟司我跂。\n山僧忽吾怪，使汝识善逝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45159,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水车","author":"沈辽","text":"黄叶渡头春水生，江中水车上下鸣。\n谁道田间得机事，不如抱瓮可忘情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45160,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"召楚兴禅师","author":"沈辽","text":"匡床我示维摩疾，持钵师来舍卫城。\n与汝欲分香积饭，不妨作戏说浮生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45161,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日二绝 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"壁下茶铛久不黔，更无白眼与人嫌。\n春来老困还多睡，时有狂风入破帘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45162,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春日二绝 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"寂寂山间谁与言，闷搔短发向香烟。\n死灰朽木君知否，不似胡人面壁禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45163,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨花","author":"沈辽","text":"岛夷三月不知春，唯有杨花似故人。\n老大相逢何可语，满头白发不胜嚬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45164,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乐神","author":"沈辽","text":"夷人事神正自醵，山头水边与神乐。\n大巫庞衣手摇铎，群儿伐鼓更鸣角。\n青山历历神欲归，湘水漓漓日脚西。\n小大酣歌向山栖，神羹满盎均汝釐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45165,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山上","author":"沈辽","text":"山上桃花红欲烧，山间病老苦无聊。\n古人有时亦好饮，已醉复醒真似劳。\n谁能忘情学枯木，不如隐几看猿猱。\n攀援上下岂无意，新林落日风??。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45166,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李华","author":"沈辽","text":"山僧种李华，华白谁肯折。\n春风欲去时，庭前纷如雪。\n绿叶始有芽，繁香且未歇。\n郁陶何可道，空庭步明月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45167,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"日落","author":"沈辽","text":"日落沙头山已昏，饥乌投暝下前村。\n谁云野客无多事，步出林间自掩门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45168,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄鹂","author":"沈辽","text":"黄鹂何处来，啼我夷即下。\n绿叶掩穷陬，春容已衰谢。\n百年如转毂，悲欢正相驾。\n感事一伤怀，吾年四十化。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45169,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"春林","author":"沈辽","text":"春林日已繁，隔我遥山青。\n下帘成幽卧，野鸟鸣嘤嘤。\n鸟鸣有时息，春林亦衰寂。\n生物自环转，何心翻戚戚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45170,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"散郎亭","author":"沈辽","text":"法华寺上散郎亭，老树苍崖如有情。\n欢戚已随时事去，代间秪有古人名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45171,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"枣花寒","author":"沈辽","text":"山禽哺雏半欲抟，坐想葛帔临风湍。\n数日阴霖复未畅，不知更作枣花寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45172,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"读书","author":"沈辽","text":"读书十车老已忘，人生得意须少壮。\n白发渐多筋力衰，谁为流年更惆怅。\n自寄蛮夷朋旧稀，更将黄卷卧斜晖。\n古来枉直何足道，昨日皦皦今还非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45173,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观大水望朝阳岩","author":"沈辽","text":"前日岩间欲结庐，下眺江水百步馀。\n春水溅溅出乳窦，青山白石半洿涂。\n不到津头已三月，谁知江水涨天墟。\n遥望横流不敢济，岩口已有人罾鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45174,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉送伯才都官代归","author":"沈辽","text":"前日使君佩铜鱼，雅望已合升华涂。\n一遭黯黮诚非辜，人为叹愤我若无。\n夷州已非人所居，况复筦库治赢馀。\n幸及瓜时笑还都，襟怀落落真丈夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45175,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵答陈生问禅","author":"沈辽","text":"从来多事笑归宗，我已无心岂有通。\n达士犹能知梦梦，世人何用更空空。\n江头冷落三秋月，山半支离一病翁。\n不到古今能与否，林间拭目看来鸿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45176,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"出潇江泊蒲洲","author":"沈辽","text":"汎汎潇江水，天生西北流。\n苍烟开蛋市，晓日下蒲洲。\n清旷适幽步，方洋如昔游。\n何为沙上鸟，相避小山头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45177,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水车","author":"沈辽","text":"山田绕山脚，江水何可作。\n车轮十丈围，飞湍半天落。\n雁翅插修筦，随流得深酌。\n升降岂无势，长江怒相薄。\n有如万夫力，欢呼倾众壑。\n曾不舍昼夜，美源终未涸。\n人间有机事，由来生巧恶。\n善彼汉阴老，忘怀抱纯朴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45178,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复作过商翁墓 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"当年不佩封侯印，后世谁寻堕泪碑。\n定远将军岂夸勇，关南常侍最能诗。\n故人不解传遗事，五岭犹能识信旗。\n墓下寂寥无鼓角，秋风独向白杨悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45179,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复作过商翁墓 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"平生气业许谁知，官制应崇九尺碑。\n已为朝廷恢远略，不应江汉独无诗。\n交牙石锁先偏阵，野烧光开后队旗。\n老妇尪残谁主奠，从来伯道使人悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45180,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复作过商翁墓 其三","author":"沈辽","text":"同预杨公国士知，延陵应得我题碑。\n人间已悟黄粱梦，泉下谁寻古剑诗。\n邕管已闻图像祭，广源无复纳降旗。\n水禽山鸟无人意，独解飞鸣不解悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45181,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"复作过商翁墓 其四","author":"沈辽","text":"苍头已作归来曲，不信全生庾氏碑。\n疑有史官争立传，终无嗣子与闻诗。\n后房已闭千金妓，私庙空收五采旗。\n闻说诏书优赠典，孤魂应结九泉悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45182,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"庭下菊","author":"沈辽","text":"夷天九月尾，秋气殊未肃。\n病士蒙葛衣，正如庭下菊。\n忆昔移菊初，夏暑方烦溽。\n瘴山旱无雨，憔悴兹不足。\n安得望茅茨，窃自譬松竹。\n神仙久视药，孤根寄穷谷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45183,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"钴鉧潭","author":"沈辽","text":"余读子厚书，始闻钴鉧潭。\n榜舟西江下，振步愚溪南。\n高下凌山阿，松篁蔽秋岚。\n土人识其地，古木森楩楠。\n水深日波澜，此理亦易探。\n古木为钴鉧，土音正相参。\n所记或不然，信书殊未甘。\n此公废已久，山水穷年耽。\n造化毫楮间，浮实微相锬。\n幽心有默识，西归助清谈。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45184,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寄题聱隅冢亭","author":"沈辽","text":"不识聱隅生，斯人亦豪怪。\n挟书海上来，轩昂轶前辈。\n何为老穷阨，独与当时背。\n宠禄出一时，此书终不废。\n客死江都馆，骸骨埋荒秽。\n幸会田使君，开茔北门外。\n浮屠清旷地，马鬣森松桧。\n百年一抔土，谁当论穷泰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45185,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙兴观","author":"沈辽","text":"山林摇落江水寒，松下古观生秋兰。\n白日无人午夜静，玉皇殿上朝仙官，但闻金环玉佩鸣珊珊。\n麻姑女子不下坛，有谁乞得延龄丹。\n人生不如为善好，草头晓露空潸潸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45186,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"还湘南集","author":"沈辽","text":"蚤识陶公父子名，未知李老思尤清。\n后来无复能文客，潇水湘山空月明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45187,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过李氏澹塘别墅","author":"沈辽","text":"渊明昔已爱吾庐，我亦悁悁忆故居。\n君有东皋千束稻，山前更望澹塘湖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45188,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答林夫五颂次元韵 其一","author":"沈辽","text":"无心难与有心期，欲说无心已自痴。\n会得金刚本来性，此人与我合先知。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45189,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答林夫五颂次元韵 其二","author":"沈辽","text":"白发生来何可惊，不求杂食岂须耕。\n山间一榻无馀事，但看山花枯复荣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45190,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答林夫五颂次元韵 其三","author":"沈辽","text":"海水浩荡烟苍茫，我欲求渡无舟航。\n东西路迷何苦渡，楞伽山下秋风凉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45191,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答林夫五颂次元韵 其四","author":"沈辽","text":"世间明闇一毫端，为底忙时不肯闲。\n水盛草深牛不动，始知缘业有多般。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45192,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"答林夫五颂次元韵 其五","author":"沈辽","text":"阿弥陀佛一炉香，欲道知时已是狂。\n若得医师除我病，何烦筋力更求方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45193,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"有感","author":"沈辽","text":"我身如断蓬，我性如孤鹤。\n飘摇寄林野，不复人间乐。\n岂如鸡与犬，朱门肆依托。\n虽沐稻粱恩，安能远嫌薄。\n理或不在我，幽怀放寥廓。\n人生能几时，百年共摇落。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45194,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠饮客","author":"沈辽","text":"鄙性不嗜饮，不知酒中乐。\n古人能闭关，此兴应可度。\n形骸委物外，宠利安能薄。\n何为攘臂人，喧卑同燕雀。\n朝挥百神王，夕引群忧涸。\n畴昔二三公，逃死向杯杓。\n我乐不在是，陶然造冲漠。\n子当剧醉时，相访南山脚。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45195,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪后","author":"沈辽","text":"潇川夜飞雪，草舍朝成冰。\n微阳始下烛，南山浩如蒸。\n林木散孚甲，乌鸟营巢橧。\n物化不可戚，深挹南天僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45196,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵酬陈生求书","author":"沈辽","text":"老朽何心托市朝，正当鼓腹咏轩尧。\n由来方外希夷乐，渐与人间路径遥。\n泽畔应无渔父问，松间时听葛天谣。\n髯君莫及儿童伎，留取褚中翡翠翘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45197,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠广祐上人","author":"沈辽","text":"不入四明路，侵寻已十年。\n葛藤论往事，蝉蜕想苍烟。\n松下数株石，岩前千丈泉。\n何为不肯往，芒屩更参禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45198,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉送马令归长沙","author":"沈辽","text":"腰间新佩临桂章，归著綵衣拜高堂。\n鸿雁知时自翔翥，骅骝得路方腾骧。\n正烦弦歌治疲俗，仰看干羽来降王。\n憔悴山间老迁客，不能相送出潇湘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45199,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"奉赠玉笥王尊师","author":"沈辽","text":"玉笥羽人不绝食，鬓毛清润颜色赤。\n中黄仙翁传妙经，十年功成人不识。\n身如孤云行无迹，欲上九疑望南极。\n岣嵝不见神禹碑，潇湘真得浮丘伯。\n城南濯足江水碧，逍遥城中混名德。\n东岩西穴已烂游，共过庐阳寻简寂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":45200,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]